WEBVTT

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:12.200
Kikou wa nori no warui

00:00:12.980 --> 00:00:15.940
Watashi ga sanka suru

00:00:16.580 --> 00:00:21.980
Hisabisa no doraibu de minna hai tenshon

00:00:22.550 --> 00:00:24.850
Kare mo kuru no

00:00:25.250 --> 00:00:28.450
Myaku ga ima wa nakutomo

00:00:29.320 --> 00:00:32.190
Zettai ikimasu tomo

00:00:32.830 --> 00:00:38.230
Sugoi sugoi pookaa faisu dato shitara

00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:41.370
Aru yo nante

00:00:41.370 --> 00:00:48.410
Umi wa hiyake suru kara, yama ni shiyou tte

00:00:49.540 --> 00:00:57.990
Koo-to no kisetsu nanoni kanchigai shiteru

00:00:58.250 --> 00:01:02.220
Doushite nano?

00:01:02.220 --> 00:01:06.190
Konna ureshikute

00:01:06.190 --> 00:01:14.000
Chigiresouna hodo waratte iru noni

00:01:14.370 --> 00:01:22.540
Kare no senaka mite wa mune tsumaru

00:01:22.540 --> 00:01:30.510
Taenai egao no utsu no naka de

00:01:34.660 --> 00:01:36.160
Episode #22
The Light

00:01:36.160 --> 00:01:38.060
Episode #22
The Light
I'm hungry.

00:01:38.060 --> 00:01:39.800
Episode #22
The Light
Didn't you eat before you came?

00:01:39.800 --> 00:01:40.960
Episode #22
The Light
I ate too much last night, so...

00:01:40.960 --> 00:01:41.720
I ate too much last night, so...

00:01:42.560 --> 00:01:45.130
My mouth tastes like coffee.

00:01:45.130 --> 00:01:47.340
How much longer are we supposed
to be here anyway?

00:01:47.340 --> 00:01:49.870
Lula said this is the safest place.

00:01:49.870 --> 00:01:51.610
It's cold.

00:01:51.610 --> 00:01:53.240
Inside the tram would've been better than this.

00:01:53.240 --> 00:01:55.510
Yeah, good point.

00:01:57.080 --> 00:01:58.410
I'll go talk to Lula.

00:01:58.410 --> 00:01:59.080
What?

00:01:59.080 --> 00:01:59.920
Food!
What?

00:01:59.920 --> 00:02:00.880
Food!
Hey, I'm coming too!

00:02:00.880 --> 00:02:03.290
Wait, we should call her first.

00:02:03.290 --> 00:02:04.810
We'll be right back.

00:02:09.560 --> 00:02:12.790
An explosion? What's going on?

00:02:19.130 --> 00:02:20.400
What? What's that noise?

00:02:20.400 --> 00:02:21.270
The bridge! Look at the bridge!

00:02:21.270 --> 00:02:22.300
Which bridge?
The bridge! Look at the bridge!

00:02:22.300 --> 00:02:23.540
It's Queensboro Bridge!

00:02:23.540 --> 00:02:24.800
The Queens side too!

00:02:40.520 --> 00:02:41.820
Nancy!

00:03:07.020 --> 00:03:09.070
You disgusting man...

00:03:09.320 --> 00:03:14.690
They said all the girls who were at the
stations got killed in the blast.

00:03:14.690 --> 00:03:16.190
I see...

00:03:16.190 --> 00:03:17.490
I'm going too.

00:03:18.330 --> 00:03:20.850
We can't afford to let them come
inside the school building.

00:03:24.270 --> 00:03:24.770
Don't get out of the car!

00:03:24.770 --> 00:03:25.800
What are we gonna do with this?
Don't get out of the car!

00:03:25.800 --> 00:03:27.240
Hey, below is no good either.
There's no way the fire trucks
can go through this mess!

00:03:27.240 --> 00:03:27.700
But they're on fire!

00:03:27.700 --> 00:03:29.140
What? It's not just the top?!
But they're on fire!

00:03:29.140 --> 00:03:31.710
I said "tram"! Stop the tram!

00:03:31.710 --> 00:03:32.470
It's "subway"!
I said "tram"! Stop the tram!

00:03:32.470 --> 00:03:33.210
It's "subway"!

00:03:33.210 --> 00:03:35.080
Yeah, both! It's "Q"! Got it? It's "Q"!

00:03:35.080 --> 00:03:35.980
No, it's "F"! F! F!
Yeah, both! It's "Q"! Got it? It's "Q"!

00:03:35.980 --> 00:03:37.150
No, it's "F"! F! F!
Are you listening to me? Hey, hello! Hello!

00:03:37.150 --> 00:03:39.280
Roosevelt is "F"!
Are you listening to me? Hey, hello! Hello!

00:03:39.280 --> 00:03:41.410
Damn it! You talk to them!

00:03:41.650 --> 00:03:43.250
Hello?
Come on, hurry up and clear the road!
Tell the men below the same! Move it, damn it!

00:03:43.250 --> 00:03:44.820
But we can't go through it!
Come on, hurry up and clear the road!
Tell the men below the same! Move it, damn it!

00:03:44.820 --> 00:03:45.620
Come on, hurry up and clear the road!
Tell the men below the same! Move it, damn it!

00:03:45.620 --> 00:03:47.620
What? It's been stopped?!

00:03:47.620 --> 00:03:49.150
Hey, there are people!

00:03:58.270 --> 00:03:59.100
Where are Claire and Kate?

00:03:59.100 --> 00:04:00.290
They're on top!
Where are Claire and Kate?

00:04:06.410 --> 00:04:07.880
Kate!

00:04:12.810 --> 00:04:14.300
Kate!

00:04:16.450 --> 00:04:18.080
You monster...

00:04:18.490 --> 00:04:20.560
I will not forgive you!

00:04:20.560 --> 00:04:23.490
Your fake words! Your fake smile!

00:04:23.490 --> 00:04:25.790
Everything...Everything was fake!

00:04:25.790 --> 00:04:30.500
What kind of consideration would I need to give
to a girl who's already dead anyway?

00:04:30.500 --> 00:04:32.970
You're a truly disgusting man.

00:04:33.540 --> 00:04:37.740
How dare you ignore my worries and
do such an awful thing?

00:04:37.740 --> 00:04:40.640
Besides, your sister that you're
holding is already...

00:04:40.640 --> 00:04:44.250
Don't talk! Things have just started for Anna!

00:04:44.250 --> 00:04:46.380
A beautiful future awaits her!

00:04:46.380 --> 00:04:49.520
She's not like you monsters
who are already done for!

00:04:49.520 --> 00:04:50.920
Take a good look at her!

00:04:50.920 --> 00:04:53.790
She's just like the people we've seen!

00:04:53.790 --> 00:04:56.160
She's about to turn into a monster who
can no longer control herself!

00:04:56.160 --> 00:04:58.690
Shut up! I said, don't talk!

00:04:58.690 --> 00:05:01.300
I can smell it! All of you stink!

00:05:01.300 --> 00:05:02.360
Huh?

00:05:02.360 --> 00:05:03.730
Brat...

00:05:03.730 --> 00:05:09.070
Anna, it's okay. I'll destroy those monsters soon.

00:05:09.070 --> 00:05:11.660
The girl you're holding is the monster!

00:05:19.480 --> 00:05:22.180
The dead have no business
talking about the living!

00:05:22.180 --> 00:05:23.150
All of you have died already!

00:05:23.150 --> 00:05:23.550
Oh, shut up!
All of you have died already!

00:05:23.550 --> 00:05:24.450
Oh, shut up!

00:05:24.450 --> 00:05:28.760
These may be false lives and bodies, but
as you can see, we are alive right now!

00:05:28.760 --> 00:05:29.890
We are not dead!

00:05:29.890 --> 00:05:32.860
Then why did you come here empty-handed?

00:05:32.860 --> 00:05:36.060
That is because your being is unnecessary!

00:05:36.060 --> 00:05:39.900
You're an unwanted being that cannot
lead anything to the future!

00:05:39.900 --> 00:05:41.640
Anna is alive.

00:05:41.640 --> 00:05:43.910
And she's being wanted this much.

00:05:43.910 --> 00:05:46.980
Even in the future she'll live on,
embracing our hopes.

00:05:46.980 --> 00:05:49.680
You're right, we don't have anything!

00:05:49.680 --> 00:05:54.350
And we may not be able to leave anything
behind for the future, but we still want to live!

00:05:54.350 --> 00:05:57.320
Does she even wish to live on?

00:05:57.320 --> 00:05:57.990
What did you say?!

00:05:57.990 --> 00:05:58.890
Ask her!
What did you say?!

00:05:58.890 --> 00:05:59.420
Ask her!

00:05:59.420 --> 00:06:02.490
Ask her if she really wants to live on
looking like that! Just ask her!

00:06:02.490 --> 00:06:04.560
This conversation is pointless!

00:06:04.560 --> 00:06:08.500
Right, Anna? They're poor girls.

00:06:11.200 --> 00:06:15.070
She's not going to make it. You can't save her!

00:06:15.070 --> 00:06:15.440
It's okay, Anna. It's not scary. It's not scary.

00:06:15.440 --> 00:06:17.370
There's nothing you can do to help her!
It's okay, Anna. It's not scary. It's not scary.

00:06:17.370 --> 00:06:17.910
It's okay, Anna. It's not scary. It's not scary.

00:06:17.910 --> 00:06:20.210
If you don't hurry up and stop this,
many people will die!

00:06:20.210 --> 00:06:24.750
That's right! But this battle is
for the sake of the future!

00:06:24.750 --> 00:06:26.870
For the sake of the beautiful future of Anna!

00:06:29.350 --> 00:06:30.940
That guy...

00:06:43.800 --> 00:06:50.530
Thank you, Claire. I think I can
be on time for the class.

00:06:56.410 --> 00:06:58.440
It's cold.

00:07:03.920 --> 00:07:05.550
Emily...

00:07:06.760 --> 00:07:13.520
Emily was so sweet. That's the truth!
For us, she tried to...

00:07:30.180 --> 00:07:31.650
President!

00:07:57.240 --> 00:07:59.140
Anna!

00:08:00.310 --> 00:08:01.830
It's okay now.

00:08:02.710 --> 00:08:04.940
I'm not worried about what those monsters said.

00:08:05.310 --> 00:08:09.040
Chili dog? That's right, we'll go get some.

00:08:13.050 --> 00:08:17.990
Oh yeah, Anna, this girl ate the chili dog too.

00:08:19.190 --> 00:08:21.730
Although, I don't think she liked it.

00:08:21.730 --> 00:08:26.360
You know something? I liked you a little bit.

00:08:26.900 --> 00:08:29.300
I'm sure Lise felt...

00:08:29.300 --> 00:08:30.810
It's sickening!

00:08:30.810 --> 00:08:34.810
The real monster isn't us or that girl. It's you.

00:08:34.810 --> 00:08:36.180
Oh yeah?

00:08:36.180 --> 00:08:41.980
It's all because of you that Lise and Emma were...
I can never forgive you.

00:08:42.520 --> 00:08:44.920
I will kill you, again.

00:08:44.920 --> 00:08:46.910
I will not die any more!

00:08:58.930 --> 00:09:00.640
I will kill you over and over again!

00:09:00.640 --> 00:09:03.200
And I will come back to life over and over again!

00:09:06.880 --> 00:09:07.640
Where's Kate?

00:09:07.640 --> 00:09:08.580
She went towards the school building.
Where's Kate?

00:09:08.580 --> 00:09:09.040
She went towards the school building.

00:09:09.610 --> 00:09:12.940
We should go too. This area should be fine now.

00:09:18.650 --> 00:09:23.930
Look, you're becoming a dead person again.
See how cold you feel.

00:09:23.930 --> 00:09:27.290
Tell me what it's like to die twice!

00:09:31.270 --> 00:09:34.240
Think you're smart, you rotten bitch!

00:09:34.240 --> 00:09:37.670
You nasty bitch who wants to see
us righteous people fall!

00:09:37.670 --> 00:09:40.410
Humans are creatures who
are born above ground.

00:09:40.410 --> 00:09:43.070
But you're nothing but a filthy dummy!

00:09:43.750 --> 00:09:47.020
Dummies are awkward beings that
don't change their shapes.

00:09:47.020 --> 00:09:49.850
You've got no future but to be broken!

00:09:50.690 --> 00:09:57.250
I guess I don't kill you.
I just break you. I just break an object.

00:09:59.530 --> 00:10:01.050
Kate!

00:10:08.670 --> 00:10:10.660
You bitch...

00:10:22.450 --> 00:10:27.980
You're just going to break, not die.
See, you're just going to break, that's all.

00:10:39.170 --> 00:10:40.660
You bitch...

00:10:41.570 --> 00:10:42.970
This is the end!

00:10:50.380 --> 00:10:53.820
I see that vulgar souls are impudent!

00:10:53.820 --> 00:10:55.410
You monster!

00:11:04.290 --> 00:11:08.700
You picked the wrong path to fall into.

00:11:08.700 --> 00:11:11.770
Sounds like what recycled beings
would come up with.

00:11:11.770 --> 00:11:14.640
Neither Anna or I would fall!

00:11:14.640 --> 00:11:18.400
You're just a monster that only exists!

00:11:19.870 --> 00:11:21.140
Lula!

00:11:31.350 --> 00:11:32.840
Come on, let's go.

00:11:35.220 --> 00:11:37.320
Lula! Lula!

00:11:42.200 --> 00:11:44.130
I can finally rest.

00:11:44.130 --> 00:11:45.660
Lula!

00:11:46.600 --> 00:11:56.000
Hey, you know something?
Living doesn't mean dying little by little.

00:11:57.110 --> 00:12:06.250
It gets created by walking and
running, little by little.

00:12:06.590 --> 00:12:08.780
That's enough, don't talk any more!

00:12:10.190 --> 00:12:16.460
Rachel...Beautiful nails...
You broke them again.

00:12:17.100 --> 00:12:23.440
And they'd grown so long too, I'm sorry.

00:12:24.040 --> 00:12:27.010
Don't apologize! I don't want you to apologize!

00:12:27.010 --> 00:12:31.650
She's right! You're the one who got
us all involved in this mess!

00:12:31.650 --> 00:12:34.150
You take responsibility for us
before you apologize to us!

00:12:34.150 --> 00:12:36.840
Take responsibility and live.

00:12:38.850 --> 00:12:41.720
I hated you.

00:12:43.320 --> 00:12:50.390
But if you die now, I will forgive
you somewhere in my heart.

00:12:53.170 --> 00:12:59.330
Kids...Seriously, you guys are kids.

00:13:00.910 --> 00:13:03.500
Lula!

00:13:20.560 --> 00:13:22.050
You guys...

00:13:22.560 --> 00:13:25.960
Thank goodness you're safe.

00:13:27.300 --> 00:13:28.670
Miss Lucy!

00:13:31.840 --> 00:13:33.040
President!

00:13:33.040 --> 00:13:37.550
Please, there's one more Dolore.

00:13:37.550 --> 00:13:40.670
A Dolore holding a girl went
inside the school building.

00:13:41.180 --> 00:13:42.980
The book of curses...

00:13:45.590 --> 00:13:46.920
Lucy...

00:13:48.160 --> 00:13:50.090
What are we gonna do now?

00:13:50.090 --> 00:13:51.580
Herve...

00:13:52.260 --> 00:13:54.820
He has the book of curses.

00:14:01.070 --> 00:14:06.470
Anna, we're almost there. Anna...

00:14:12.110 --> 00:14:12.880
Huh?

00:14:12.880 --> 00:14:13.410
What is it?
Huh?

00:14:13.410 --> 00:14:13.980
What is it?

00:14:13.980 --> 00:14:15.350
Is that him?

00:14:15.750 --> 00:14:16.910
Lise?

00:14:23.190 --> 00:14:24.660
Lise?

00:14:26.490 --> 00:14:27.900
Kate...

00:14:27.900 --> 00:14:32.300
What? Lise! You know who I am?

00:14:32.300 --> 00:14:38.340
Oh...Claire, Rose, Rachel too...

00:14:38.340 --> 00:14:41.100
Lise, that's right! It's me!

00:14:43.710 --> 00:14:45.350
Lise!

00:14:45.350 --> 00:14:47.010
Thank goodness!

00:14:47.620 --> 00:14:49.380
What's the matter, Rose?

00:14:49.380 --> 00:14:51.220
Come with us, Lise!

00:14:51.220 --> 00:14:54.360
What about the class?
Grace will give me a ticket.

00:14:54.360 --> 00:14:57.290
Don't worry about that, Lise. Just don't worry!

00:14:57.760 --> 00:15:02.830
Lise, I'm glad. I'm so glad!

00:15:02.830 --> 00:15:06.200
What happened to you guys?
Look how dirty your clothes are!

00:15:08.840 --> 00:15:12.360
It's okay now. It's really Lise!

00:15:13.010 --> 00:15:14.700
Claire?

00:15:16.910 --> 00:15:20.280
Lise...Lise...

00:15:20.280 --> 00:15:29.280
Kate, you know what? It looks like I found
a boyfriend. He's such a sweet person.

00:15:31.290 --> 00:15:34.820
Lise...Lise...

00:15:35.430 --> 00:15:36.900
Kate...

00:15:47.170 --> 00:15:48.910
Lise, go into a classroom.

00:15:48.910 --> 00:15:50.610
Kate? What about him?

00:15:50.610 --> 00:15:51.840
No!

00:15:52.150 --> 00:15:54.880
Anna, hang in there, okay?

00:15:56.020 --> 00:15:57.110
Anna?

00:15:57.690 --> 00:16:00.280
Anna?

00:16:00.690 --> 00:16:01.420
That girl...

00:16:01.420 --> 00:16:01.960
Anna! It's okay! I said, it's okay!
That girl...

00:16:01.960 --> 00:16:04.620
Anna! It's okay! I said, it's okay!

00:16:05.730 --> 00:16:08.890
Anna...Anna...

00:16:10.460 --> 00:16:11.860
I said, it's okay.

00:16:14.200 --> 00:16:17.800
Anna! Anna! Anna!

00:16:19.140 --> 00:16:20.540
Anna!

00:16:23.040 --> 00:16:25.850
Anna!

00:16:25.850 --> 00:16:28.820
Anna...Anna...

00:16:29.220 --> 00:16:33.380
Sorry...I'm sorry, Anna.

00:16:47.840 --> 00:16:51.170
Anna!

00:17:07.320 --> 00:17:09.290
Big brother...

00:17:15.600 --> 00:17:23.330
Anna...Anna...Anna...

00:17:42.090 --> 00:17:48.220
I've always believed it. I've always believed
that someone would deliver it to us.

00:17:49.100 --> 00:17:54.630
Place the book of curses here.
Put it on top of the other one.

00:18:02.180 --> 00:18:04.970
Now, we can finally die.

00:18:05.580 --> 00:18:08.640
We will live.

00:18:09.050 --> 00:18:11.950
Even if it means forever?

00:18:13.220 --> 00:18:14.480
Yes...

00:18:15.860 --> 00:18:21.730
I see. Goodbye. Thank you.

00:18:27.230 --> 00:18:31.190
Where should we go when we wake up?

00:18:31.840 --> 00:18:36.840
Oh, I didn't think about that at all.

00:18:36.840 --> 00:18:38.280
Me either.

00:18:38.280 --> 00:18:41.110
First things first, let's eat something!

00:18:42.080 --> 00:18:43.550
That's the first thing to do?!

00:18:43.550 --> 00:18:50.220
Yeah, but I understand. We eat, relax,
then take time to figure it out.

00:18:50.220 --> 00:18:52.690
Yeah, sounds good.

00:18:53.430 --> 00:18:55.160
We're gonna take time.

00:18:55.500 --> 00:18:57.260
We're not alone.

00:18:57.600 --> 00:19:00.360
So, let's take our time, together.

00:19:12.380 --> 00:19:21.010
You know what? It looks like I found a
boyfriend. He's such a sweet person.

00:19:22.260 --> 00:19:30.100
I was wandering around in the amusement park
by myself and that boy came and talked to me.

00:19:31.700 --> 00:19:35.160
I never felt that way inside before.

00:19:36.000 --> 00:19:45.970
It was so much fun. Even though we had just
met, we rode on the Ferris wheel together.

00:19:47.480 --> 00:19:53.320
The two of us going around and around...

00:19:55.360 --> 00:19:59.450
Over and over again...
